    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Celebration of God’s Justice"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: according to Muth-labben. A psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will thank the Lord with all my heart;",
          "I will declare all your wondrous works."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will rejoice and boast about you;",
          "I will sing about your name, Most High."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When my enemies retreat,",
          "they stumble and perish before you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For you have upheld my just cause;",
          "you are seated on your throne as a righteous judge."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have rebuked the nations:",
          "You have destroyed the wicked;",
          "you have erased their name forever and ever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The enemy has come to eternal ruin;",
          "you have uprooted the cities,",
          "and the very memory of them has perished."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But the Lord sits enthroned forever;",
          "he has established his throne for judgment."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And he judges the world with righteousness;",
          "he executes judgment on the nations with fairness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord is a refuge for the persecuted,",
          "a refuge in times of trouble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Those who know your name trust in you",
          "because you have not abandoned",
          "those who seek you, Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sing to the Lord, who dwells in Zion;",
          "proclaim his deeds among the nations."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the one who seeks an accounting",
          "for bloodshed remembers them;",
          "he does not forget the cry of the oppressed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Be gracious to me, Lord;",
          "consider my affliction at the hands of those who hate me.",
          "Lift me up from the gates of death,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "so that I may declare all your praises.",
          "I will rejoice in your salvation",
          "within the gates of Daughter Zion."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The nations have fallen into the pit they made;",
          "their foot is caught in the net they have concealed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord has made himself known;",
          "he has executed justice,",
          "snaring the wicked",
          "by the work of their hands. ."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Higgaion"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wicked will return to Sheol —",
          "all the nations that forget God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the needy will not always be forgotten;",
          "the hope of the oppressed will not perish forever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Rise up, Lord! Do not let mere humans prevail;",
          "let the nations be judged in your presence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Put terror in them, Lord;",
          "let the nations know they are only humans."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
